# Synthetic single-species DM_REAM fixture (Blip5, basis code 3) for the EAM
# collapse tests: 4 pair bumps + 3 density bumps + 5 embedding bumps, four of
# which cover rho = 0 (|SEMBFUNC*CEMBFUNC| < 3), so the embedding reference
# EMBF0 matters (no EMBF0 line: the default ZERO applies). RHOFORM SIGNED
# (every density amplitude is > 0, so the MONOTONE test reuses the file with
# RHOFORM MONOTONE).
ATOM              Ta
BIAS              false
INIT2B            true
INITMB            true
MODEL             M_BLR   BF_Linear
NORM              false
TYPE2B            D2_Blip5   4   4   Ta   Ta
CGRID2B           2.5   3.2   3.9   4.5
SGRID2B           3.0   3.0   3.0   3.0
TYPEMB            DM_REAM   3   3   3   3   5   5   0   0   Ta   Ta
CGRIDMB           2.8   3.6   4.4
SGRIDMB           3.0   3.0   3.0
AMPGRIDMB         0.5   0.3   0.1
RHOFORM           SIGNED
CEMBFUNC          -0.2   0.3   0.8   1.3   1.8
SEMBFUNC          2.0   2.0   2.0   2.0   2.0
RCTYPE2B          Cut_Dummy
RCTYPEMB          Cut_Dummy
RCUT2B            5.5
RCUTMB            5.5
WATOM             1.0
WEIGHTS           0.8   -0.3   0.1   -0.05   -2.0   1.5   -0.7   0.4   0.2
